<section aria-label="The mechanism">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head head--idx"><div class="head-body">
      <h2 class="display">The <em>Sous Cycle&trade;.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Traditional matcha preparation changes pace for a reason. Faster movement suspends the sifted matcha evenly in the water. A slower finish settles larger bubbles and refines the microfoam. The Sous Cycle&trade; changes pace the same way, automatically, once you press start.</p>
    </div></div>
    <div class="split-body" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vh,44px)">
      <div class="split-item"><b>01</b><div><h3>Incorporate</h3><p>A fast vortex creates an even suspension.</p></div></div>
      <div class="split-item"><b>02</b><div><h3>Refine</h3><p>Sous changes pace to settle larger bubbles and leave a finer microfoam.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px">
      <p>Fast to incorporate. Slow to refine.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

